WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:04.310
Speaker 1: Many of you have been emailing
me saying, David, you're on Rumble, the right

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:06.890
wing sort of clone of YouTube.

00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:09.380
Are you going to get truth social?

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:10.860
Trump's right wing clone of Twitter?

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:17.430
And the answer is I've actually tried, but
I'm unable to get on and many questions as

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:23.880
to why yet another one of these right wing
app launches has gone horribly wrong.

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:28.450
And indeed, there are now reports that Donald
Trump is completely furious about the failure

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:32.050
of this completely farcical social media app.

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:39.200
The Daily Beast is reporting that Donald Trump
is just going completely bonkers as Donald

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.380
Trump weighs another run for the White House.

00:00:41.380 --> 00:00:46.440
He embarked on a new business opportunity,
which is truth social, and it's looking like

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:48.079
an embarrassing dud.

00:00:48.079 --> 00:00:53.190
In recent weeks, sources have heard the former
president on the phone swearing gratuitously

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:56.990
and asking things like What the f is going
on?

00:00:56.990 --> 00:01:01.700
He's repeatedly groused about the negative
press and the less than stellar optics of

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:02.700
the rollout.

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:03.899
These sources said.

00:01:03.899 --> 00:01:08.210
And he's demanded to know why more people
aren't using it, why the app isn't swiftly

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:09.870
dominating the competition now.

00:01:09.870 --> 00:01:12.549
I think there's actually two parts to this.

00:01:12.549 --> 00:01:16.930
There's the technical disaster, and there's
the part where not a lot of people care about

00:01:16.930 --> 00:01:19.830
the app on the technical side.

00:01:19.830 --> 00:01:23.380
When I tried to sign up, I don't have an iPhone,
so I couldn't.

00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:24.380
I couldn't.

00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:25.380
I just had to get on a beta.

00:01:25.380 --> 00:01:26.380
Yeah, a beta.

00:01:26.380 --> 00:01:31.920
No on a waiting list for the Android beta.

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:34.610
And so if you don't have an iPhone, you're
just out.

00:01:34.610 --> 00:01:38.920
But even people with iPhones have said, you
know, they're like number 80000 on the waitlist

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:40.250
and it just doesn't go anywhere.

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:45.299
So there's like the technical side, but also
what's the point of the app?

00:01:45.299 --> 00:01:51.810
I mean, what I mean by that is what they basically
marketed as is, you know, all of the stuff

00:01:51.810 --> 00:01:57.150
we can't say everywhere else because it's
disinformation and violates terms of service.

00:01:57.150 --> 00:02:01.070
You will be allowed to say here, so come here
to say it.

00:02:01.070 --> 00:02:04.829
But then the problem is it's just a stupid
echo chamber and it's just the people that

00:02:04.829 --> 00:02:07.400
spread the misinformation, spreading it to
each other.

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:11.310
And then like journalists who just want to
see what's going on or people like me who

00:02:11.310 --> 00:02:15.810
I'm like, Well, it sounds funny, I'll try
to sign up.

00:02:15.810 --> 00:02:19.730
But so there's the technical problem and the
fact that not that many people are interested

00:02:19.730 --> 00:02:20.730
in this.

00:02:20.730 --> 00:02:23.390
So everything, everything going wrong.

00:02:23.390 --> 00:02:29.020
If the preliminary traffic numbers are of
any indication, the former president and current

00:02:29.020 --> 00:02:36.690
wannabe social media mogul has a point about
the low traffic the Daily Beast reviewed analysis

00:02:36.690 --> 00:02:45.510
of visits to truth social and these are they
describe the numbers as anemic and that Trump's

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:54.830
truth social is doing worse or the same as
other MAGA social sites like Gab Getter.

00:02:54.830 --> 00:03:00.680
And then you've got Rumble Rumble seems to
actually be doing a little bit better, but

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:08.440
it's not going particularly well, and I don't
know as far as the waiting list how even if

00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:13.070
everybody from the waiting list got on, it
still doesn't seem like it would be particularly

00:03:13.070 --> 00:03:14.070
successful.

00:03:14.070 --> 00:03:21.550
So I don't really pretend to know what it
would take to launch a real, bona fide competitor

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:27.930
to like Twitter, Facebook, YouTube, etc. because
I'm the first to admit that, you know, there's

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:29.330
these network effects.

00:03:29.330 --> 00:03:33.690
And so when we say, Well, if you don't like
the rules on YouTube, start your own fine.

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:34.690
Sure.

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:38.970
We also have to concede that once YouTube
has so much market power, it becomes more

00:03:38.970 --> 00:03:42.140
and more difficult to really build something
successful.

00:03:42.140 --> 00:03:44.410
As an alternative, I completely get that.

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:50.500
But at the same time, the premise here like
this is where you go for your right wing stuff.

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:54.769
They call it for free speech, where you can
say anything but you actually can't like try

00:03:54.769 --> 00:03:59.560
criticizing Trump on some of these platforms
you actually will get will get banned, but

00:03:59.560 --> 00:04:07.640
you need to appeal to someone other than those
people in order to build a successful app.

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:14.269
Because the hardcore MAGA people that are
so hardcore that they'll abandon Twitter and

00:04:14.269 --> 00:04:19.659
Facebook for something like this, it's a relatively
small crowd, and so it was clear what this

00:04:19.659 --> 00:04:21.509
was going to be.

00:04:21.509 --> 00:04:26.830
There's other platforms trying to fill the
niche of like the hard right MAGA clown type

00:04:26.830 --> 00:04:30.189
platform, and it's unlikely that this is going
to succeed.

00:04:30.189 --> 00:04:31.189
My prediction?

00:04:31.189 --> 00:04:33.949
It's very quietly never spoken about.

00:04:33.949 --> 00:04:37.949
They don't shut it down because shutting it
down would be admitting defeat.

00:04:37.949 --> 00:04:39.689
They just don't really talk about it.

00:04:39.689 --> 00:04:40.689
And if asked.

00:04:40.689 --> 00:04:42.990
Trump says there's great interest in it's
continuing to build.

00:04:42.990 --> 00:04:44.020
That's my prediction.

00:04:44.020 --> 00:04:58.029
Let me know what 

00:04:58.029 --> 00:05:44.379
you expect.

